"},"produced":null,"reason":{"code":"speaker_turn","facts":["u_0042","S2"],"text":"Cut to the guest, who starts speaking at 2:46"},"ref":{"src":"src_4da2b43c72a36da9b7605595","t0":166.45,"t1":168.9},"score":0.9},{"by":"recipes","confidence":0.77,"id":"k_0027","kind":"punch_in","optional":true,"params":{"clause_start":"w_0052_00","interp":"ease-out","keys":[{"interp":"ease-out","t":146.6507,"values":{"scale":1.0,"x":0.0,"y":0.0}},{"interp":"ease-out","t":147.0507,"values":{"scale":1.1,"x":0.0,"y":0.0}}],"peak_word":"w_0052_02","piece":[143.85,148.4],"props":["scale","x","y"],"push_s":0.4,"release":"step@148.4","scale":1.1},"produced":null,"reason":{"code":"emphasis_peak","facts":["s_0052","w_0052_02"],"text":"Punched in on “The sensor stays” (from 2:26): said louder and slower than the rest"},"ref":{"src":"src_4da2b43c72a36da9b7605595","t0":146.6507,"t1":147.8903},"score":0.8},{"by":"recipes","confidence":0.8,"id":"k_0028","kind":"jump_cut_hide","optional":true,"params":{"from_scale":1.0,"interp":"step","keys":[{"interp":"step","t":30.7,"values":{"scale":1.08,"x":0.0,"y":0.0}},{"interp":"step","t":30.8,"values":{"scale":1.08,"x":0.0,"y":0.0}}],"piece":[30.7,34.0],"props":["scale","x","y"],"scale":1.08,"step":0.08},"produced":null,"reason":{"code":"jump_cut_hide","facts":["sil_0006"],"text":"Stepped the zoom from 100% to 108% at 0:30 so the jump does not show"},"ref":{"src":"src_4da2b43c72a36da9b7605595","t0":30.7,"t1":30.75},"score":0.7},{"by":"recipes","confidence":0.8,"id":"k_0029","kind":"jump_cut_hide","optional":true,"params":{"from_scale":1.0,"interp":"step","keys":[{"interp":"step","t":89.3,"values":{"scale":1.08,"x":0.0,"y":0.0}},{"interp":"step","t":89.4,"values":{"scale":1.08,"x":0.0,"y":0.0}}],"piece":[89.3,93.55],"props":["scale","x","y"],"scale":1.08,"step":0.08},"produced":null,"reason":{"code":"jump_cut_hide","facts":["sil_0021"],"text":"Stepped the zoom from 100% to 108% at 1:28 so the jump does not show"},"ref":{"src":"src_4da2b43c72a36da9b7605595","t0":89.3,"t1":89.35},"score":0.7},{"by":"recipes","confidence":1.0,"id":"k_0030","kind":"captions","optional":false,"params":{"cues":[{"spk":"S1","t0":0.5176,"t1":1.852,"text":"Welcome back to the show."},{"spk":"S1","t0":2.0416,"t1":5.7088,"text":"Today I am talking to a founder\nwho builds cameras in a garage."},{"spk":"S1","t0":5.9438,"t1":7.0296,"text":"How did this start?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":7.5981,"t1":12.1882,"text":"We started in 2019 with three\npeople and one soldering iron."},{"spk":"S2","t0":12.4675,"t1":15.3666,"text":"Nobody thought a garage\nteam could ship a camera."},{"spk":"S2","t0":16.8903,"t1":19.2069,"text":"The first prototype\nwas heavy and the"},{"spk":"S2","t0":19.2069,"t1":21.4626,"text":"battery barely lasted\na coffee break."},{"spk":"S1","t0":22.076,"t1":23.3061,"text":"So what changed?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":24.4856,"t1":28.0905,"text":"We threw away the case and\nstarted again from the sensor."},{"spk":"S2","t0":30.6012,"t1":33.129,"text":"That was the hardest month\nof the whole project."},{"spk":"S1","t0":33.7192,"t1":35.0715,"text":"Why the sensor first?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":35.6402,"t1":37.8999,"text":"Because everything\nelse follows from it."},{"spk":"S2","t0":38.1939,"t1":40.8142,"text":"The lens, the heat,\nthe size of the body."},{"spk":"S2","t0":42.2995,"t1":46.0076,"text":"Once the sensor was fixed, the\ncase almost designed itself."},{"spk":"S1","t0":46.7622,"t1":49.3246,"text":"Let's talk about the\nnumber everyone quotes."},{"spk":"S1","t0":49.5156,"t1":51.6021,"text":"What did the second\nprototype do?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":52.1913,"t1":55.1088,"text":"Our second prototype\nshot ninety minutes of"},{"spk":"S2","t0":55.1088,"t1":58.1589,"text":"four K on one charge,\nthe longest in its class."},{"spk":"S1","t0":58.7267,"t1":59.9357,"text":"That is a big claim."},{"spk":"S1","t0":60.1867,"t1":61.2802,"text":"How did you measure it?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":62.4812,"t1":64.9452,"text":"We ran it on a bench\nwith a fan pointed"},{"spk":"S2","t0":64.9452,"t1":67.4709,"text":"at the sensor, then\nagain without the fan."},{"spk":"S1","t0":68.0126,"t1":70.4609,"text":"Most teams would have\nstopped at the bench test."},{"spk":"S1","t0":72.0179,"t1":72.7255,"text":"You did not."},{"spk":"S1","t0":72.9185,"t1":74.6829,"text":"What did the field\ntest look like?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":76.779,"t1":79.9588,"text":"So the second test was a\nweek on a fishing boat in"},{"spk":"S1","t0":79.9588,"t1":80.0901,"text":"A fishing"},{"spk":"S2","t0":80.0901,"t1":80.5789,"text":"the rain."},{"spk":"S1","t0":80.5789,"t1":80.9789,"text":"boat."},{"spk":"S1","t0":81.082,"t1":82.3159,"text":"That sounds miserable."},{"spk":"S2","t0":82.8903,"t1":85.0962,"text":"It was the week I almost quit,"},{"spk":"S2","t0":85.0962,"t1":88.1109,"text":"and I still think\nabout it every morning."},{"spk":"S2","t0":89.1937,"t1":91.0356,"text":"But the camera\ncame back working,"},{"spk":"S2","t0":91.0356,"t1":92.5985,"text":"and that changed everything."},{"spk":"S1","t0":93.7126,"t1":95.9396,"text":"What did the boat teach\nyou about the design?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":96.6364,"t1":98.0962,"text":"Salt gets everywhere."},{"spk":"S2","t0":98.3534,"t1":102.0717,"text":"Every seam, every button,\nevery port needs a gasket."},{"spk":"S1","t0":103.9622,"t1":105.2118,"text":"Let's move to the team."},{"spk":"S1","t0":105.4626,"t1":107.9539,"text":"How do you hire for\nsomething this specialised?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":108.5799,"t1":109.2149,"text":"Slowly."},{"spk":"S2","t0":109.4544,"t1":113.3612,"text":"We hire people who have shipped\none hard thing, whatever it was."},{"spk":"S1","t0":113.9185,"t1":116.2244,"text":"That rules out most\nfresh graduates."},{"spk":"S1","t0":117.8117,"t1":118.2983,"text":"Does it?"},{"spk":"S1","t0":118.5243,"t1":120.041,"text":"Who was the best hire you made?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":120.6428,"t1":122.0851,"text":"A retired watchmaker."},{"spk":"S2","t0":122.3116,"t1":125.6425,"text":"She taught us that tolerance\nis a habit, not a number."},{"spk":"S1","t0":126.7058,"t1":127.4224,"text":"I love that."},{"spk":"S1","t0":127.6122,"t1":128.9654,"text":"Let's talk about money."},{"spk":"S2","t0":129.5428,"t1":131.1472,"text":"Money was the boring part."},{"spk":"S2","t0":131.3999,"t1":134.2861,"text":"We sold prototypes to\npay for the next one."},{"spk":"S1","t0":134.8603,"t1":136.122,"text":"No investors at all?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":136.6942,"t1":139.558,"text":"Not until the boat\ntest proved the design."},{"spk":"S1","t0":141.5166,"t1":143.0383,"text":"What is next for the camera?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":143.5902,"t1":146.045,"text":"A smaller body and\na better screen."},{"spk":"S2","t0":146.3007,"t1":147.5403,"text":"The sensor stays."},{"spk":"S1","t0":148.126,"t1":149.5019,"text":"So the hard part is done."},{"spk":"S2","t0":150.1943,"t1":151.9476,"text":"The hard part is never done."},{"spk":"S2","t0":152.238,"t1":153.494,"text":"It just moves."},{"spk":"S1","t0":154.0618,"t1":154.9292,"text":"Last question."},{"spk":"S1","t0":155.2265,"t1":158.1685,"text":"What would you tell someone\nstarting in a garage today?"},{"spk":"S2","t0":158.7105,"t1":162.2657,"text":"Ship one thing that works before\nyou design the second thing."},{"spk":"S1","t0":162.8185,"t1":164.2267,"text":"That is a good place to end."},{"spk":"S1","t0":164.5982,"t1":165.5984,"text":"Thank you for coming."},{"spk":"S2","t0":166.19,"t1":167.4647,"text":"Thank you for having me."}],"look":{"background":"#000000AA","size":56,"upper":false},"max_chars":32,"mode":"podcast","position":"bottom","src":"src_4da2b43c72a36da9b7605595","style":"default"},"produced":null,"reason":{"code":"caption_mode","facts":[],"text":"Added Podcast captions: clean readable lines, one person at a time"},"ref":null,"score":1.0},{"by":"recipes","confidence":1.0,"id":"k_0031","kind":"dialogue","optional":false,"params":{"lane":"a1","mute_camera_mics":true,"offsets":{"src_1ae7bf0dbff9036a43b7e83f":0.0,"src_4da2b43c72a36da9b7605595":0.35,"src_c67c61c7c53f4